                        // THE TAUTOLOGY — P ∨ ¬P, which is true no matter what you put in it.
                        //
                        // `knockback_growth: 0.0`, and it is the whole move. `scaled_
                        // knockback` short-circuits a zero growth and returns the base untouched,
                        // so this throw ignores the victim's percent AND their weight: it sends a
                        // fresh featherweight and a 200% heavyweight to the SAME height, every
                        // time. Nothing else in the game does that. It is never a kill and never
                        // gets worse — a juggle he can rely on the way he relies on a theorem.
                        //
                        // 145 base is deliberately ABOVE his f-throw's 138, and that is the
                        // trade rather than a mistake: it out-launches everything he has at 0%
                        // and is the weakest thing he has at 120%, where the f-throw's 1.9 growth
                        // has more than doubled it.
